OL,3,GNEWSAMajor disruption after person hit
OL,4,Aby train
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services are expected to be
OL,7,Fdisrupted for the rest of the day after
OL,8,Fa person was hit by a train.
OL,10,FThe British Transport Police said it
OL,11,Fwas called to Hatfield railway station
OL,12,Fat 13:39 GMT to reports of a "casualty
OL,13,Fon the tracks".
OL,15,FThey were taken to hospital with
OL,16,Finjuries not thought to be
OL,17,Flife-threatening or life-changing.
