OL,3,GNEWSAMajor disruption after person hit
OL,4,Aby train
OL,5,
OL,6,FLines have since reopened between
OL,7,FLondon King's Cross and Stevenage, but
OL,8,Fthe operator, London North Eastern
OL,9,FRailway (LNER), said to expect delays
OL,10,Fand cancellations for the rest of the
OL,11,Fday.
